    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、本当に手伝ってもらっていいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈のお願いって『俺の作る物』だから\r\n一緒にやったら意味ないんじゃ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "──いいのっ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "一緒に作った方が、楽しそうだもん☆",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、甘奈がいいなら\r\n俺は構わないけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
