  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アボカドサラダ、豚肉の梅干しソース掛け\r\n夏野菜の炒めもの……どれも美味しそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちなみに、このメニューって\r\nどういうセレクトなんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "この前、お母さんが作ってくれた\r\n夏バテに効く美味しいレシピだよ☆",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "たとえば、梅干しは食欲増進してくれるし\r\nこっちのお野菜はミネラルたっぷりなんだよ～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おぉ……なるほどな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　だから、\r\nプロデューサーさんもたくさん食べようねっ☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、そうさせてもらうよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、甘奈、手際よかったな\r\n普段から料理とかするんだっけ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "時々お母さんの手伝いするくらいだよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんはあまりやらないの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020130"
  },
  {
    "select": "まぁまぁかな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "必要最低限かな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "全然やらないな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、でも、しないわけじゃないんだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あんまりやらないのかなぁ\r\nとか思ってたかも。ごめんね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこまでちゃんとしたものは作らないから\r\n間違ってはいないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとりだと、食べられればいいやって\r\n思っちゃうから、どうしてもな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうなんだね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、わかる気がする……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お手伝いした時に甜花ちゃんとか\r\nみんなが美味しいって言ってくれるの、うれしくて",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "その言葉のためにやってるところもあるから\r\n甘奈も自分ひとりだと、そうなっちゃうかも",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020190"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "出来合いのものが何もない時、\r\nやるくらいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お仕事で遅くなっちゃうと、残ってないんだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。それに、疲れてると\r\n作る気があまり起きなくてな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうだよね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうだ！　プロデューサーさん\r\n時々、うちにご飯食べにくる？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんもきっと喜ぶし！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、ありがとうな、気持ちは嬉しいけど\r\nご迷惑だろうし、やめておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うーん、そっかぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020240"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だいたいコンビニとかで弁当買っちゃうんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お仕事、忙しいもんね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、これからは少し頑張るよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかくいいメニューを教えてもらったし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうしてくれるとうれしいな！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たまにちゃんと作ると\r\nいい気晴らしになる感じがするし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、\r\nお料理どんどん上手になっちゃったりして",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、腕が上がったら\r\nまた甘奈に食べてもらおうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014011020280,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、楽しみにしてるよ☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401102/2014011020280"
  },
